│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ clique_partition_codebook                                                                 │
│ patch_description        │ This version replaces the small-graph GED / random-density approach with a structured     │
│                          │ invariant codebook.                                                                       │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Each message graph is a disjoint union of two cliques and isolated vertices. Its sorted   │
│                          │ degree sequence is preserved by vertex shuffling and remains informative after edge-flip  │
│                          │ noise. A greedy maximin selection chooses clique partitions with widely separated sorted  │
│                          │ degree profiles. During decoding, it uses both:                                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ - total edge count likelihood, and                                                        │
│                          │ - centered sorted-degree-profile likelihood.                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This provides substantially more shuffle-invariant information than edge count alone      │
│                          │ while avoiding expensive graph-isomorphism matching. The vertex count is selected from    │
│                          │ the noise level and increased only enough to provide at least `M` distinct structural     │
│                          │ codewords.                                                                                │
