│                          │ L*epsilon*(1-epsilon), estimates nearest-boundary error using a Gaussian tail, converts   │
│                          │ this to the expected multiplicative 0.9^E effect over 100 queries, and includes the 1/N   │
│                          │ score factor.                                                                             │
